10 REM ============================================================
20 REM HB-1 IN LOGO: A HOUSE WITH A GARDEN
30 REM The same machine, a different ROM. Nothing here is BASIC:
40 REM in, or CS, or SETPC. Select LOGO in the ROM socket, load
50 REM this listing, and the turtle draws on the graphics pane
60 REM beside the tube -- the canvas the machine and the IDE share.
70 REM ============================================================
80 CS
90 SETPC 6
100 SETPENWIDTH 2
110 REPEAT 4 [ FD 90 RT 90 ]
120 REM --- the roof, a triangle over the walls ------------------
130 PU
140 HOME
150 FD 90
160 RT 90
170 FD 90
180 LT 90
190 PD
200 SETPC 4
210 REPEAT 3 [ FD 90 RT 120 ]
220 REM --- a door, in the middle of the front wall --------------
230 PU
240 HOME
250 FD 90
260 RT 90
270 FD 40
280 LT 90
290 PD
300 SETPC 1
310 REPEAT 2 [ FD 40 RT 90 FD 25 RT 90 ]
320 REM --- a sun, and a garden of flowers -----------------------
330 PU
340 HOME
350 RT 90
360 FD 200
370 LT 90
380 PD
390 SETPC 6
400 REPEAT 12 [ FD 30 BK 30 RT 30 ]
410 PU
420 HOME
430 FD 130
440 LT 90
450 FD 60
460 PD
470 SETPC 2
480 REPEAT 5 [ FD 20 RT 90 FD 40 RT 90 FD 20 LT 180 ]
490 PU
500 HOME
510 FD 130
520 LT 90
530 FD 100
540 PD
550 REPEAT 5 [ FD 20 RT 90 FD 40 RT 90 FD 20 LT 180 ]
560 PU
570 HOME
580 SETPC 7
590 REPEAT 8 [ FD 90 RT 45 ]
600 PRINT "THE TURTLE IS THE OTHER HALF OF THE MACHINE."
